#: adf7681efbf149a1ad707b2af3aac3ce
msgid "Noise from the electronics in your aircraft (such as your motor, ESC, autopilot etc)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:72
#: 86c5eeb7585143179d3a272469750221
msgid "Noise from your ground station computer, especially its USB bus"
